    <string name="row_default_guide">Default launcher setup guide</string>
    <string name="default_launcher_steps">1. Press the Home button on the remote.\n2. If Android asks which app to use, choose Akaa Flix Launcher and then \"Always\".\n3. Android 10 and newer: Settings → Apps → Default apps → Home app → Akaa Flix Launcher (or use \"Set as default launcher\" above).\n4. Android TV boxes: Settings → Apps → Default apps / Home (the name differs between manufacturers).\n\nGoogle TV and some manufacturer firmwares (Xiaomi Google TV boxes included) offer no chooser. There, use \"Make default with Shizuku\", or from a computer:\nadb shell cmd role add-role-holder --user 0 android.app.role.HOME com.akaaflix.launcher\nIf the old launcher still opens, disable it (reversible):\nadb shell pm disable-user --user 0 com.google.android.apps.tv.launcherx\n\nAfterwards the start-up line above shows \"Verified\" once Android has opened Akaa Flix after a restart.</string>
