    <string name="am_shizuku_help">Shizuku lets Akaa Flix run package-manager commands with the same rights as ADB, only after you allow it:\n1. Install Shizuku (Play Store or github.com/RikkaApps/Shizuku).\n2. Start Shizuku: on Android 11+ with Wireless debugging, or from a computer or an ADB app on this device:\nadb shell sh /storage/emulated/0/Android/data/moe.shizuku.privileged.api/start.sh\n3. Come back here and choose \"Allow\".\nWithout root, Shizuku must be started again after every restart. Akaa Flix never has these rights by itself.</string>
